    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1B0AA1358C89B85C",
      "text": "Zutaten und Würzmittel.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1B0AA4358C89BD75",
      "text": "Schnelligkeit.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_g_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "1B0AA3358C89BBC2",
      "text": "Viel Liebe.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_01",
      "hash64": "044A470EB5724ACA",
      "text": "Das ist korrekt, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\c\\nHast du vielleicht schon zu Hause in der Küche\\nmitgeholfen und wusstest deshalb Bescheid?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_02",
      "hash64": "044A460EB5724917",
      "text": "Das ist leider falsch.\\c\\nBei der Zubereitung gilt, besser langsam und\\nsorgfältig als schnell und geschludert.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_answer_03",
      "hash64": "044A450EB5724764",
      "text": "Ha! Das ist ja mal eine interessante Antwort.\\c\\nIch hatte etwas anderes erwartet, aber eigentlich\\nist die Antwort gar nicht mal so verkehrt.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_11",
      "hash64": "1BDBFAB3555C84E4",
      "text": "Man kann schon behaupten, dass es die Zutaten,\\nalso der Belag und die Würzmittel sind, die in\\r\\nhilfreicheren S-Kräften resultieren.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_12",
      "hash64": "1BDBFDB3555C89FD",
      "text": "Mit vielen süßen Zutaten erhält man zum Beispiel\\ndie Eikraft leichter.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_13",
      "hash64": "1BDBFCB3555C884A",
      "text": "Verwendet man derweil viele bittere Zutaten,\\nbekommt man leichter die Fundkraft.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_14",
      "hash64": "1BDBF7B3555C7FCB",
      "text": "Wenn man weiß, welchen Effekt man erzielen\\nmöchte, macht die Zubereitung von Sandwiches\\r\\ngleich noch mehr Spaß.\\c\\nUnd wer gerade nicht selbst kochen möchte, kann\\nauch durch die Gerichte in Restaurants in den\\r\\nGenuss der entsprechenden S-Kräfte kommen.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 210,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 256,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_15",
      "hash64": "1BDBF6B3555C7E18",
      "text": "Wenn ihr euch neues Wissen aneignet und so\\ntiefere Einblicke in die Hauswirtschaftslehre\\r\\nerlangt, könnte ich zufriedener nicht sein.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_g_01_home_16",
      "hash64": "1BDBF9B3555C8331",
      "text": "Damit wäre der Unterricht beendet.\\nWenn ihr mich jetzt entschuldigen würdet...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
